{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/270178-the-jfk-scenario-one-of-my-players-is-going-to-the-white-house","id":270178,"title":"the JFK scenario: one of my players is going to the white house...","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-10-01T10:20:29-07:00","id":270178,"title":"the JFK scenario: one of my players is going to the white house...","content":"time ago i was running a DtF game in which one of the demons took over a politician (What a shock) and hes been struggling a lot to make USA his personal cult by revealing himself on TV once he becomes president......<br /> <br /> So...Any suggestions?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-01T11:06:18-07:00","id":270202,"title":"","content":"Seems like NPCs from basically every other kind of supernatural would have it very much in their best interest to keep this from happening, probably trying to detect this kind of stuff early on. I'm not all that familiar with Demon as a line, but as soon as your PC's presidential ambitions are revealed, don't you think that some of the nation's random werewolves/mages/vampires/hunters/whatever population will start trying to find ways to verify he's human?<br /> <br /> Being revealed within the supernatural / hunter communities at large, a solid year before the election, seems like where the fun _starts_. Hope he's got a hell of a lot of friends!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2214-traveller","name":"Traveller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2214_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-01T14:53:47-07:00","id":270415,"title":"","content":"Doesn't the New World Order already know how the next 8 presidential elections are going to turn out? Won't they just edit that revelation shit out if he tries doing it on Syndicate-run media, drop a dozen HIT-MARKS on the site, and call the resulting carnage a tragic gas main explosion?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I seem to have acquired a site for running play by post games. This is unexpected and frightening and come watch either the glorious play or the magnificent train wreck:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://madnessforums.com/forums/index.php\" target=\"_blank\">The Malkavian Madness Network</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1515-benjcano","name":"BenjCano","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1515_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1276"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-02T02:50:38-07:00","id":270670,"title":"","content":"Correct me if I'm wrong, but there is a &quot;Chaoscopic scanners&quot; in the White House.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> With astonishing alacrity and utter secrecy, the organization deployed these \u201cchaoscopic scanners\u201d in locations including Dulles International Airport, the Pentagon, the Eisenhower Executive Office Building, the Capitol, and the White House, all behind the fa\u00e7ades of new metal detectors. </div> </div> </div>We are not told, if it could sense Demon (basically - &quot;an alien entiety possessing human body&quot;), but if it could &quot;see&quot; Wraiths and the Shadowlands - this is also possible. So, even ordinary mortal hunters would know this character true origin and act accordingly.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3479-von-lyttenburgh","name":"von Lyttenburgh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3479_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-02T05:04:52-07:00","id":270733,"title":"","content":"Do you want him to succeed? We can simWod all we want but it the history of WOD isn't a &quot;people pull off the best possible thing always&quot; there are mistakes, errors, misplannings.<br /> <br /> So the first thing you have to ask yourself is do you want the game to move into that sort of direction? IF no tell your player that's a bit too overt for the game you want to play, rather than coming up with all sorts of SimWOD rocks fall everyone dies stuff.<br /> <br /> IF yes decide the level of opposition you are comfortable throwing at him. You have of course the Technocracy in all its flavors. The Camarilla and Sabbat both having theirown reasons for going &quot;DEMON PRESIDENT BAD&quot;. Same with Garou, Same with Tradition Mages same with the countless wraiths of the whitehouse, Hunters of various stripes(Both reckoning and other). And of course Lucifer's got to be seriously pissed if this goes through.<br /> <br /> Now many of you are looking at this long list of potential list of obstacles as insurmountable, I will of course present to you the rise of the Ravnos Antedeluvian and the clusterfuck around it. A bunch of KJ came to kill him, they were winning then everyone else showed up, made things worse and worse, until the technocracy dropped a bunch of nukes broke a chunk of the universe and still failed. They eventually used a sattilite to melt him with sunlight but signfiicant damage had been done that didn't have to be if people had just left the KJ to murder Rav.<br /> <br /> So I imagine one advantage your player has is all those groups firing off at the same time. The technocracy isn't going to just &quot;let the camarilla handle it&quot; they will get involved. So will random heroes who &quot;Know better&quot; and so on and so forth at the very least there should be a complete and utter clusterfuck of supernatural proprotions. This may be enough of an edge for the player to get through.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-02T07:44:43-07:00","id":270812,"title":"","content":"Introduce other demons who have the same idea. Make them fight it out for the prize.<br /> <br /> You could make the Whitehouse an Earthbound. (Are they even still around in Fallen?)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-02T09:22:04-07:00","id":270856,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Michael</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/270178-the-jfk-scenario-one-of-my-players-is-going-to-the-white-house?p=270812#post270812\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Introduce other demons who have the same idea. Make them fight it out for the prize.<br /> <br /> You could make the Whitehouse an Earthbound. (Are they even still around in Fallen?)</div> </div> </div> </div>Lesser Demon: Oi lucifer..So..Did the Earthbounds came back?<br /> Lucifer : Yeah..erm...they never left<br /> Belia: EXCELSIOR! !!!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}